<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1131] IllegalArgumentException in IgniteUtils#resolveProjectHome()</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1131</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When Ignite is packaged to war and run on JBoss IgniteUtils#resolveProjectHome() throws IllegalArgumentException when trying to convert URL like vfs:/C:/Users/foo/foo-ear.ear/bar.war/WEB-INF/lib/ignite-core-1.3.1.jar to java.io.File.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Ignite-as-L2-cache-in-JBoss6-td538.html#a664&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Ignite-as-L2-cache-in-JBoss6-td538.html#a664&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12845863">IGNITE-1131</key>
            <summary>IllegalArgumentException in IgniteUtils#resolveProjectHome()</summary>
