                            <comment id="14631216" author="sevdokimov-gg" created="Fri, 17 Jul 2015 11:33:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fix: Added caching IllegalArgumentException when creating &quot;new File(classesUri)&quot;. If exception thrown resolveProjectHome() will return null, Ignite can works without IGNITE_HOME&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reviewed by: Yakov&lt;br/&gt;
Merged to: origin/master&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
